Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:13:05 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1026/1198] YuE2 OS: the logo, no web links in the workspace,
 take IDs, a player that follows the list

- Header: the YuE2 OS logo (the favicon's treble clef, the word, an OS plate that inverts by
  night through --amber/--on-amber). The three links to GitHub left the header; the sources
  live in the Engine room's About, with a YuE2 OS block for what this fork adds.
- The page title is YuE2 OS.
- The take card shows its ID (the folder in outputs/); a click copies it.
- A click on another take in the list while one plays switches the player to it and plays.
- Toasts stay five seconds longer.
- Style and lyrics no longer jump while typing at their row cap: at the cap nothing is
  re-measured, and below it every scrolling parent keeps its place.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
